              AI-assisted where it accelerates execution. Human-led where
              product risk is real.
            </h3>
          </div>
          <p>
            I use AI tools to speed up exploration, prototyping, and
            repetitive implementation, while keeping architecture, review,
            quality control, and production decisions firmly grounded in
            senior engineering judgment.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="expertise-grid">
          <article class="feature-card">
            <i class="bi bi-diagram-3"></i>
            <h3>Architecture That Supports Scale</h3>
