          </article>
          <article class="feature-card">
            <i class="bi bi-speedometer2"></i>
            <h3>Performance That Protects Growth</h3>
            <p>
              Fixing bottlenecks, improving response times, and lowering
              system strain before performance issues become customer-facing
              problems.
            </p>
            <span class="feature-meta"
              >Outcome: faster products and more efficient
              infrastructure.</span
            >
          </article>
          <article class="feature-card">
            <i class="bi bi-kanban"></i>
            <h3>Smarter Product Delivery</h3>
            <p>
              Moving from product requirements to dependable features with the
              right balance of speed, maintainability, and release confidence.
            </p>
            <span class="feature-meta"
