            >
          </article>
          <article class="feature-card">
            <i class="bi bi-cloud-arrow-up"></i>
            <h3>Cloud Workflows With Safer Releases</h3>
            <p>
              Improving deployment workflows, CI/CD, observability, and cloud
              operations so releases are safer and easier to manage.
            </p>
            <span class="feature-meta"
              >Outcome: stronger release reliability and lower operational
              risk.</span
            >
          </article>
          <article class="feature-card">
            <i class="bi bi-shield-check"></i>
            <h3>Quality Control and Technical Judgment</h3>
            <p>
              Keeping codebases modular, reviewable, and easier for teams to
              build on without accumulating expensive technical debt.
            </p>
            <span class="feature-meta"
              >Outcome: software that remains maintainable as teams and
              features expand.</span
            >
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="skills" class="skills section">
      <div class="container" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <div>
            <span class="section-kicker">Core Stack</span>
            <h2>Curated technical depth across the product stack</h2>
